'''Drinking Age''' (おさけは二十歳になってから, ''O Sake wa Nijussai ni Natte Kara'', '''No Alcohol Until Drinking Age''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. It was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

